# Calendar exports and feed URLs. An .ics export contains the full contents
# of the work calendar, and the secret iCal address is a credential that
# grants read access to all of it — neither belongs in a GitHub repo.
*.ics
local/

# Break chimes are third-party stock audio, kept out of the repo rather
# than redistributed. The app finds whatever is in here at runtime.
assets/sound-effects/
